  "slug": "summer-tortellini-salad-with-arugula-recipe-12020301",
  "name": "Summer Tortellini Salad with Arugula",
  "recipe_type": "salad",
  "brief_description": "This summer tortellini salad with arugula tastes like summer in a bowl. Made with cheese tortellini, crisp vegetables, and peppery arugula, it\u2019s delicious as a side dish or easily transformed into a satisfying main dish with chicken or salami.",
  "cuisine": "American",
  "instructions": [
    {
      "position": 1,
      "text": "Cook tortellini according to package directions. Drain and rinse under cool water, then set aside to cool completely, about 15 minutes."
    },
    {
      "position": 2,
      "text": "Add cooked tortellini to a bowl. Add tomatoes, onions, radishes, radish greens or arugula leaves, and Parmesan cheese. Add Italian dressing by the tablespoon, stirring the salad and tasting until you have as much as you like. Serve at room temperature or place in the refrigerator to chill before serving."
    }
  ],
  "servings": 4,
  "cooking_time_minutes": 15,
  "preparation_time_minutes": 10,
